              "data": []
            }
          },
          "docs": "<p>Deletes an existing persons relationship to the accounts legal entity. Any person with a relationship for an account can be deleted through the API, except if the person is the <code>account_opener</code>. If your integration is using the <code>executive</code> parameter, you cannot delete the only verified <code>executive</code> on file.</p>"
